1
00:00:00,171 --> 00:00:03,071
(Sheldon(off):)Nice to meet you, Professor Proton.

2
00:00:03,708 --> 00:00:04,728
(Sheldon(off):)Nice to meet you, Profe...

3
00:00:04,909 --> 00:00:06,429
(Sheldon(off):)Ow!

4
00:00:26,798 --> 00:00:28,228
(Sheldon(off):)Leonard?

5
00:00:30,468 --> 00:00:32,228
(Leonard:)What?

6
00:00:32,603 --> 00:00:34,593
(Sheldon(off):)I still can't sleep.

7
00:00:37,342 --> 00:00:39,872
She really, uh, tuckered herself out
at the park, huh?

8
00:00:40,111 --> 00:00:42,241
(Bernadette:)Yeah. You two were so cute
playing together.

9
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:47,210
(Howard:)It was kind of fun throwing a ball
and not having anyone laugh at me.

10
00:00:47,819 --> 00:00:52,019
(Bernadette:)And you were sweet not to throw it too far
so she didn't wear out her tiny legs.

11
00:00:52,223 --> 00:00:56,023
Heh, yeah, that's what I was doing.

